  "983dfe0b-8406-465c-8059-079b5243aa85": "Provides reference and status information on the original transactions, included in the original instruction, to which the cancellation request message applies.",
  "989c79b0-c096-45d8-b73c-e0001d518247": "Specifies the split details.",
