  "_QTaCONp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1893102243": "Account to or from which a securities entry is made.",
  "_QTjzNNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1662748352": "Account to or from which a securities entry is made.",
  "_QTjzOdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1222075847": "Account to or from which a securities entry is made.",
  "_QTs9I9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-569609182": "Safekeeping or investment account. A safekeeping account is an account on which a securities entry is made. An investment account is an account between an investor(s) and a fund manager or a fund. The account can contain holdings in any investment fund or investment fund class managed (or distributed) by the fund manager, within the same fund family.",
