  "_tziaQTqeEeKqTf3MbquCbA": "Numerical representation of the nett increases and decreases in an account at a specific point in time. A cash balance is calculated from a sum of cash credits minus a sum of cash debits.",
  "_u0cgsYr8EeSvuOJS0mmL0g": "Configuration of the digital signatures if the security module is able to perform digital signatures with an asymmetric key.",
