  "_0BPS9zEyEe6g-ffJsqGiSA": "Indicator of the urgency or order of importance that the instructing agent would like the market infrastructure to apply to the processing of the settlement instruction.||Usage: Market practice or bilateral agreement should specify how this element should be used. If this element is not populated and there is no market guidance or bilateral agreement, the priority will be considered as 'Normal'.",
  "_0BPS_TEyEe6g-ffJsqGiSA": "Credit or debit transaction contained in an individual settlement request.||Usage: The sum of all amounts (debit and credit records) should net to zero where net settlement is used.",
