  "_2cgbhTEyEe6g-ffJsqGiSA": "The MessagingEndpoint designated by the sending MessagingEndpoint to be the recipient who will ultimately process this Business Message.||Note the receiving MessagingEndpoint might be different from the receiving address potentially contained in the transport header (as defined in the transport layer).",
