  "_qHFnB5e-EfCsfrvk22Hpaw": "Date on which the amount of money ceases to be available to the agent that owes it and when the amount of money becomes available to the agent to which it is due.||Usage: The InterbankSettlementDate is the interbank settlement date of the reversal message, and not of the original instruction.",
