  "b7bc8a68-9213-4294-86ab-429e499ac74f": "Agent between the debtor's agent and the creditor's agent.||Usage: If more than one intermediary agent is present, then IntermediaryAgent1 identifies the agent between the DebtorAgent and the IntermediaryAgent2.",
