  "_8J5r9aMgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_-1729127672": "Reservation is blocked or frozen due to external circumstances such as a court order, death of beneficiary or account owner, or bankruptcy.",
  "_8JT2IqMgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_-393464774": "Restriction is the rejection during the settlement instruction validation.",
  "_8JdAA6MgEeCJ6YNENx4h-w_927638380": "Restriction of linked to the balance type that defines and manages position types for securities positions.",
