  "__zRBAdojEeC60axPepSq7g_678467242": "Acting as an agent for some executions and principal for others in the same transaction.",
  "__zRBAtojEeC60axPepSq7g_232419284": "Party acting as an agent for both customer and another person.",
  "__zRBBNojEeC60axPepSq7g_686506553": "Dealer or specialist that is trading for their own account in the OTC market. Market makers are expected to maintain an orderly market by being available to buy or sell.",
  "__zaK89ojEeC60axPepSq7g_-1016772421": "Party appointed by the Fund Management Company. It updates records of investor accounts to reflect the daily investor purchases, redemptions, switches, transfers, and re-registrations. It ensures the timely settlement of transactions, and may provide tax information to the investor and/or to its intermediaries. It may calculate, collect, and rebate commissions. It prepares and distributes confirmations reflecting transactions, resulting in unit or cash account movements to the investor or the investor's intermediary. It responds to inquiries concerning account status, and processes the income distribution.",
  "__zaK8NojEeC60axPepSq7g_-2084392447": "Multilateral Trading Facility (MTF) is a multilateral system which brings together multiple third-party buying and selling interests in financial instruments in a way that results in a contract.",
  "__zaK8dojEeC60axPepSq7g_-1777537574": "Regulated market on which financial instruments can be traded according to rules defined by the stock exchange.",
  "__zaK8tojEeC60axPepSq7g_-253469278": "Firms which, on an organised, frequent and systematic basis, deal on their own account by executing client orders outside a regulated market or an MTF. SIs have the obligation to provide, and make public, a definite bid and offer quote for liquid securities.",
  "__zaK9dojEeC60axPepSq7g_946389513": "Trading as Agent on behalf of a customer.",
  "__zaK9tojEeC60axPepSq7g_-729579691": "Party acting as an agent for both customer and another person.",
  "__zj789ojEeC60axPepSq7g_153653596": "Acting as an agent for some executions and principal for others in the same transaction.",
  "__zj78NojEeC60axPepSq7g_-1990766827": "Crossing as an agent.",
  "__zj78dojEeC60axPepSq7g_1386150177": "Crossing as a principal.",
  "__zj78tojEeC60axPepSq7g_1420967182": "Acting as an agent for a party other than a customer.",
  "__zj79NojEeC60axPepSq7g_-2025583832": "Trading as Principal.",
  "__ztF5NojEeC60axPepSq7g_1743002948": "Number assigned by a government agency to identify foreign nationals.",
  "__ztF5dojEeC60axPepSq7g_-721218168": "Number assigned to a tax exempt entity.",
  "_a-7Js9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1485265523": "A guaranteed bank cheque with a future value date (do not pay before], which in commercial terms is a 'negotiatable instrument': the beneficiary can receive early payment from any bank under subtraction of a discount. The ordering customer's account is debited on value date.",
  "_a-7JsNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1485265041": "Cheque drawn on the account of the debtor, and debited on the debtor's account when the cheque is cashed. Synonym is 'corporate cheque'.",
  "_a-7Jsdp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1485265119": "Cheque drawn on the account of the debtor, and debited on the debtor's account when the cheque is cashed. The financial institution prints and certifies the cheque, guaranteeing the payment.",
  "_a-7Jstp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_1485265197": "Cheque drawn on the account of the debtor's financial institution, which is debited on the debtor's account when the cheque is issued.These cheques are printed by the debtor's financial institution and payment is guaranteed by the financial institution. Synonym is 'cashier's cheque'.",
  "_a-7JtNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-1349960623": "An instrument with a future value date (do not pay before], which in commercial terms is a 'negotiatable instrument': the beneficiary can receive early payment from any bank under subtraction of a discount. The ordering customer's account is debited on value date.",
