  "_ahauVNp-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_-773188205": "Booked means that the transfer of money has been completed between account servicer and account owner||Usage: |Status Booked does not necessarily imply finality of money as this depends on other factors such as the payment system used, the completion of the end-to-end transaction and the terms agreed between account servicer and owner.|Status Booked is the only status that can be reversed.",
