  "_bIJTcUr5EeSHP9pzU4nIpA": "Unrecognised or invalid investor party. May be used by an executing party to reject an instruction for an investor (or portfolio) for which it is not authorised to act.",
  "_bMfEk9p-Ed-ak6NoX_4Aeg_160952572": "Option to choose cash.",
