  "_dYEI-5xCEe-Jl6tBAvMHqA": "Replace an existing key using a Higher Level Authority (HLA) key. In the TR34 scheme this would be used to implement a HLA Rebind operation.",
  "_dYEI-ZxCEe-Jl6tBAvMHqA": "Send a specific message to initiate a process.",
